TCP 10.160.1.2:12001 -> 10.160.1.1:12000 CLOSED -> SYN_SENT (connect)
TCP 10.160.1.2:12001 -> 10.160.1.1:12000 SYN_SENT -> SYN_RECEIVED (simultaneous open)
TCP 10.160.1.2:12001 -> 10.160.1.1:12000 SYN_RECEIVED -> ESTABLISHED (handshake)
TCP 10.160.1.2:12001 -> 10.160.1.1:12000 ESTABLISHED -> FIN_WAIT_1 (close)
TCP 10.160.1.2:12001 -> 10.160.1.1:12000 FIN_WAIT_1 -> CLOSING (peer fin)
TCP 10.160.1.2:12001 -> 10.160.1.1:12000 CLOSING -> TIME_WAIT (fin acked)
